MID_LGV_1_M00_Nom_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_1_M00_Nom_m01_001: I am Nomved—the high priest in charge of\nthis temple.
MID_LGV_1_M00_Nom_m01_002: This sacred place welcomes many from across the\nempire who are involved with blacksmithing.
MID_LGV_1_M00_Nom_m01_003: The divine Credna is unavailable to grant you\nan audience in our temple.
MID_LGV_1_M00_Nom_m01_004: We do accept acts of service at any time, however.\nPlease speak to temple reception if you're interested.
MID_LGA_1_M00_Nom_m01: <BLN>This temple...
MID_LGV_1_M00_RibeiraVillage_B01_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_1_M00_RibeiraVillage_B01_m01_001: Welcome to peaceful Ribeira. That's the best thing,\nand really the only thing, about it—it's peaceful.
MID_LGA_1_M00_RibeiraVillage_B01_m01: <BLN>Welcome to Ribeira.
MID_LGV_1_M00_RibeiraVillage_B02_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_1_M00_RibeiraVillage_B02_m01_001: Seems like some ne'er-do-wells have settled in at the\nGalen Fort Ruins. That's close by, unfortunately.
MID_LGV_1_M00_RibeiraVillage_B02_m01_002: An attack could come at any moment. We'd all do\nwell to be on our guard!
MID_LGA_1_M00_RibeiraVillage_B02_m01: <BLN>Be on your guard!
MID_LGV_1_M00_RibeiraVillage_B03_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_1_M00_RibeiraVillage_B03_m01_001: The Great August asked me to deliver something for\nhim, and that's just what I'll do.
MID_LGV_1_M00_RibeiraVillage_B03_m01_002: Come to think of it though, I haven't seen his\ngranddaughter, Tialla, lately. I hope she's well.
MID_LGA_1_M00_RibeiraVillage_B03_m01: <BLN>I hope she's well.
MID_LGV_1_M00_RibeiraVillage_B03_m02: <TH>
MID_LGV_1_M00_RibeiraVillage_B03_m02_001: Cai, you're back! Are Tialla and Peter with you?
MID_LGV_1_M00_RibeiraVillage_B03_m02_002: Without you three, this village has been too quiet.\nIt's just not the same!
MID_LGA_1_M00_RibeiraVillage_B03_m02: <BLN>You're back!
MID_LGV_1_M00_RibeiraVillage_B04_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_1_M00_RibeiraVillage_B04_m01_001: A traveler? Ooh, how exciting! Why are you here?
MID_LGA_1_M00_RibeiraVillage_B04_m01: <BLN>Why are you here?
MID_LGV_1_M00_RibeiraVillage_B05_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_1_M00_RibeiraVillage_B05_m01_001: Whoa! How pretty. I knew it!
MID_LGV_1_M00_RibeiraVillage_B05_m01_002: Travelers always dress pretty!
MID_LGA_1_M00_RibeiraVillage_B05_m01: <BLN>Pretty!
MID_LGV_1_M00_RibeiraVillage_B05_m02: <TH>
MID_LGV_1_M00_RibeiraVillage_B05_m02_001: Welcome back, Cai! You look good. Guess you\nlike traveling!
MID_LGV_1_M00_RibeiraVillage_B05_m02_002: Tell me all about Dagsion when you can!
MID_LGA_1_M00_RibeiraVillage_B05_m02: <BLN>Welcome back!
MID_LGV_1_M00_RibeiraVillage_B06_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_1_M00_RibeiraVillage_B06_m01_001: So the Heroic Games are going on in Dagsion right\nnow, I hear!
MID_LGV_1_M00_RibeiraVillage_B06_m01_002: I'd love to attend, but traveling's too risky.
MID_LGA_1_M00_RibeiraVillage_B06_m01: <BLN>The games?
MID_LGV_1_M00_RibeiraVillage_B07_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_1_M00_RibeiraVillage_B07_m01_001: It's rare to see outsiders. This village is so far out\nof the way...
MID_LGV_1_M00_RibeiraVillage_B07_m01_002: Please don't cause any trouble. It's a peaceful village.
MID_LGA_1_M00_RibeiraVillage_B07_m01: <BLN>Oh, my.
MID_LGV_1_M00_RibeiraVillage_B07_m02: <TH>
MID_LGV_1_M00_RibeiraVillage_B07_m02_001: You should take the chance to explore the world\nwhile you're young. See what there is to see.
MID_LGV_1_M00_RibeiraVillage_B07_m02_002: Just don't forget that you'll always have a home here,\nand we'll be here waiting for you.
MID_LGA_1_M00_RibeiraVillage_B07_m02: <BLN>You'll always have a home here.
MID_LGV_1_M00_FinaVillage_B01_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_1_M00_FinaVillage_B01_m01_001: It feels like it was just yesterday when that no-good\nRanda did his best to destroy this village.
MID_LGV_1_M00_FinaVillage_B01_m01_002: None of us would be here now if nobody had put\na stop to him. But we made it, somehow!
MID_LGA_1_M00_FinaVillage_B01_m01: <BLN>People, I tell you!
MID_LGV_1_M00_FinaVillage_B02_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_1_M00_FinaVillage_B02_m01_001: Huh. We don't get many visitors. It's just a small\nfishing village, after all.
MID_LGV_1_M00_FinaVillage_B02_m01_002: Why would you come here, traveler? There's nothing\nto see or do.
MID_LGA_1_M00_FinaVillage_B02_m01: <BLN>Nothing to see or do.
MID_LGV_1_M00_FinaVillage_B03_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_1_M00_FinaVillage_B03_m01_001: I miss Esme... Where'd she go?
MID_LGV_1_M00_FinaVillage_B03_m01_002: Wherever she is, she's strong and she'll be safe. I just\nknow it!
MID_LGA_1_M00_FinaVillage_B03_m01: <BLN>Where'd she go?
MID_LGV_1_M00_FinaVillage_B04_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_1_M00_FinaVillage_B04_m01_001: I've always dreamed of living the city life. Someday,\nI want to visit Dagsion.
MID_LGV_1_M00_FinaVillage_B04_m01_002: Go to the theater, then head to a tavern with friends.\nThey say there are beautiful thermae too.
MID_LGV_1_M00_FinaVillage_B04_m01_003: And just maybe, while I'm there...I'll meet that\nspecial someone. I can just picture it now!
MID_LGA_1_M00_FinaVillage_B04_m01: <BLN>What a nice dream...
MID_LGV_1_M00_FinaVillage_B05_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_1_M00_FinaVillage_B05_m01_001: That reminds me... I had better repair my net before\nI head out again.
MID_LGV_1_M00_FinaVillage_B05_m01_002: It's older than I am! Problem is, I can't afford a\nnew one.
MID_LGA_1_M00_FinaVillage_B05_m01: <BLN>Better mend it.
MID_LGV_1_M00_FinaVillage_B06_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_1_M00_FinaVillage_B06_m01_001: You know, I could watch the sea all day long and\nnever get bored.
MID_LGV_1_M00_FinaVillage_B06_m01_002: Listening to the waves is so calming.
MID_LGA_1_M00_FinaVillage_B06_m01: <BLN>Listen to the waves...
MID_LGV_1_M00_Kassito_B01_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_1_M00_Kassito_B01_m01_001: We don't get many travelers out in these parts.
MID_LGV_1_M00_Kassito_B01_m01_002: I'm not sure what you came to this town to do, but\nyou're welcome here.
MID_LGA_1_M00_Kassito_B01_m01: <BLN>Oh, a traveler?
MID_LGV_1_M00_Kassito_B02_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_1_M00_Kassito_B02_m01_001: This town bears the scars of a terrible battle fought\nhere some years ago.
MID_LGV_1_M00_Kassito_B02_m01_002: Just the other day, terrible things happened\nhere again.
MID_LGV_1_M00_Kassito_B02_m01_003: Makes me sick, it does.
MID_LGA_1_M00_Kassito_B02_m01: <BLN>Makes me sick.
MID_LGV_1_M00_Kassito_B03_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_1_M00_Kassito_B03_m01_001: After the Cydonia Massacre, many of the shops here\nstayed shut for good.
MID_LGV_1_M00_Kassito_B03_m01_002: We get a merchant visiting now and again, but...
MID_LGV_1_M00_Kassito_B03_m01_003: There's no inn, so most travelers just pass us by.
MID_LGA_1_M00_Kassito_B03_m01: <BLN>Wish it was different.
MID_LGV_1_M00_Kassito_B04_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_1_M00_Kassito_B04_m01_001: You there! I don't recognize you. You're not from\naround here. What are you up to?
MID_LGV_1_M00_Kassito_B04_m01_002: If you have no business in the city, clear off. We\ndon't permit loitering.
MID_LGA_1_M00_Kassito_B04_m01: <BLN>What business do you have?
MID_LGV_1_M00_Kassito_B05_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_1_M00_Kassito_B05_m01_001: This is Kassite, in Cydonia. It's Aragonian territory\nthese days, since the massacre.
MID_LGV_1_M00_Kassito_B05_m01_002: The bards call it the city of tragedy.
MID_LGA_1_M00_Kassito_B05_m01: <BLN>This is Kassite.
MID_LGV_1_M00_Kassito_B06_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_1_M00_Kassito_B06_m01_001: Until recently, this place was governed by Viceroy\nBalboa. She's dead now.
MID_LGV_1_M00_Kassito_B06_m01_002: The kingdom of Arago did its best to stop things\nfrom coming to a head, but, well...
MID_LGV_1_M00_Kassito_B06_m01_003: That didn't pan out. In fact, they just looted the city.\nIt was chaos, and many fled.
MID_LGA_1_M00_Kassito_B06_m01: <BLN>It was chaos.
MID_LGV_1_M00_Underground_B01_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_1_M00_Underground_B01_m01_001: Check out these muscles. They're my real\nmoneymakers.
MID_LGV_1_M00_Underground_B01_m01_002: If I want to earn my coin, I can't shirk my training.
MID_LGA_1_M00_Underground_B01_m01: <BLN>Can't shirk my training.
MID_LGV_1_M00_Underground_B02_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_1_M00_Underground_B02_m01_001: Wander around if you want, but don't stir up trouble.
MID_LGV_1_M00_Underground_B02_m01_002: If you get to thinking you can do whatever you like,\nGabriel will show you that you're wrong.
MID_LGA_1_M00_Underground_B02_m01: <BLN>Keep your head down.
MID_LGV_1_M00_Underground_B03_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_1_M00_Underground_B03_m01_001: This is the place for people who like to see blood.
MID_LGV_1_M00_Underground_B03_m01_002: Some people feel sorry for us, but truth is, I'm happy\nto be here.
MID_LGA_1_M00_Underground_B03_m01: <BLN>Happy to be here.
MID_LGV_1_M00_Underground_B04_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_1_M00_Underground_B04_m01_001: One good thing about being underground is that it's\nnice and cool.
MID_LGV_1_M00_Underground_B04_m01_002: 'Course, it also stinks like sweat and it's moldy. So it's\nnot all great.
MID_LGA_1_M00_Underground_B04_m01: <BLN>One good thing...
MID_LGV_1_M00_Underground_B05_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_1_M00_Underground_B05_m01_001: Being stuck down here, you start longing for the\nhustle and bustle of town.
MID_LGV_1_M00_Underground_B05_m01_002: Sure, there's plenty of excitement here too, but I miss\nthe sun.
MID_LGA_1_M00_Underground_B05_m01: <BLN>No sun.
MID_LGV_1_M00_Underground_B06_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_1_M00_Underground_B06_m01_001: Whoa, whoa, whoa! Would you take a look at that?\nMy blade's chipped.
MID_LGV_1_M00_Underground_B06_m01_002: Time to head over to the blacksmith and get it\nsharpened up.
MID_LGA_1_M00_Underground_B06_m01: <BLN>Whoa, whoa, whoa!
MID_LGV_1_M00_Underground_B07_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_1_M00_Underground_B07_m01_001: I hear tell that the Heroic Games are going\non aboveground.
MID_LGV_1_M00_Underground_B07_m01_002: Sounds like a sight. I'd love to go take 'em in. Hope\nthey're still going by the time I get out.
MID_LGA_1_M00_Underground_B07_m01: <BLN>Sounds like a sight!
MID_LGV_1_M00_KunlunVillage_B01_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_1_M00_KunlunVillage_B01_m01_001: I'm so hungry... And I want some water...
MID_LGV_1_M00_KunlunVillage_B01_m01_002: Anatolia will do something though! I know she will!
MID_LGV_1_M00_KunlunVillage_B01_m01_003: Till then, I gotta keep going!
MID_LGA_1_M00_KunlunVillage_B01_m01: <BLN>Gotta keep going!
MID_LGV_1_M00_KunlunVillage_B02_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_1_M00_KunlunVillage_B02_m01_001: Even in a land this parched, dig deep and you might\nfind groundwater.
MID_LGV_1_M00_KunlunVillage_B02_m01_002: Our scanners are shot though. All we can rely on\nthese days is luck.
MID_LGV_1_M00_KunlunVillage_B02_m01_003: And if your luck isn't good enough, you're just\nwasting your time.
MID_LGA_1_M00_KunlunVillage_B02_m01: <BLN>If we're lucky...
MID_LGV_1_M00_KunlunVillage_B03_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_1_M00_KunlunVillage_B03_m01_001: That's not good. My Salamander broke. It's been\npassed down in my family for generations.
MID_LGV_1_M00_KunlunVillage_B03_m01_002: Before Dadao left, I'd just bribe him with a snack and\nhe'd fix it for me.
MID_LGV_1_M00_KunlunVillage_B03_m01_003: But now that he's gone...I'm all of a sudden realizing\nhow much I relied on him.
MID_LGA_1_M00_KunlunVillage_B03_m01: <BLN>That's not good.
MID_LGV_1_M00_KunlunVillage_B04_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_1_M00_KunlunVillage_B04_m01_001: Years ago, my grandson was banished from the\nvillage for breaking the rules.
MID_LGV_1_M00_KunlunVillage_B04_m01_002: The chances are slim...but I want to believe he made\nit through the wall safe and sound.
MID_LGA_1_M00_KunlunVillage_B04_m01: <BLN>I want to believe...
MID_LGV_1_M00_KunlunVillage_B05_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_1_M00_KunlunVillage_B05_m01_001: Master Long told me that once, long ago, some\npeople left this village and founded a grand kingdom.
MID_LGV_1_M00_KunlunVillage_B05_m01_002: Incredible, isn't it? I wish I could visit.
MID_LGA_1_M00_KunlunVillage_B05_m01: <BLN>I wish I could visit.
MID_LGV_1_M00_KunlunVillage_B06_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_1_M00_KunlunVillage_B06_m01_001: Lately, Master Zenon hasn't been well.
MID_LGV_1_M00_KunlunVillage_B06_m01_002: If he collapses...I'm not sure the village can make it\nwithout him.
MID_LGA_1_M00_KunlunVillage_B06_m01: <BLN>I'm worried.
MID_LGV_1_M00_KunlunVillage_B07_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_1_M00_KunlunVillage_B07_m01_001: They say the outer shell of Nuwa is collapsing on the\nwestern side. Don't head out that way.
MID_LGV_1_M00_KunlunVillage_B07_m01_002: Even a tiny piece falling from so high up could\nbe fatal.
MID_LGA_1_M00_KunlunVillage_B07_m01: <BLN>Be careful!
MID_LGV_1_M00_KunlunVillage_B08_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_1_M00_KunlunVillage_B08_m01_001: My grandpa told me this was a ship that sailed on\nthe sea of stars.
MID_LGV_1_M00_KunlunVillage_B08_m01_002: Even seeing it up close like this, it doesn't feel real.
MID_LGA_1_M00_KunlunVillage_B08_m01: <BLN>Doesn't feel real...
MID_LGV_1_M00_StMeridaBranch_B01_m01: 
