MID_LGA_1_M00_StMeridaBranch_B07_m01: 
MID_LGV_1_M00_TempleFotona_B01_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_1_M00_TempleFotona_B01_m01_001: Welcome. This is the temple of Fortuna, the Goddess\nof Fate.
MID_LGV_1_M00_TempleFotona_B01_m01_002: At this temple, we do not call on volunteers to serve.
MID_LGV_1_M00_TempleFotona_B01_m01_003: If you wish to devote yourself to our goddess, why\nnot stay and worship?
MID_LGA_1_M00_TempleFotona_B01_m01: <BLN>Welcome to the temple of Fortuna.
MID_LGV_1_M00_TempleFotona_B02_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_1_M00_TempleFotona_B02_m01_001: This temple's Gate of the Gods is always closed and,\nin fact, has never been used.
MID_LGV_1_M00_TempleFotona_B02_m01_002: Yet someday, the goddess Fortuna may choose to\nmake her appearance.
MID_LGV_1_M00_TempleFotona_B02_m01_003: We diligently care for the Gate so that it is ready\nshould that day come.
MID_LGA_1_M00_TempleFotona_B02_m01: <BLN>We must remain diligent.
MID_LGV_1_M00_TempleFotona_B03_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_1_M00_TempleFotona_B03_m01_001: According to records left by the high priest of two\ngenerations ago...
MID_LGV_1_M00_TempleFotona_B03_m01_002: the goddess Fortuna is often of ill temper and\ndifficult to please.
MID_LGV_1_M00_TempleFotona_B03_m01_003: Because she is the next youngest after Aurora, a\nthought occurs.
MID_LGV_1_M00_TempleFotona_B03_m01_004: Perhaps she is of a delicate spirit, with\nchildlike composure.
MID_LGA_1_M00_TempleFotona_B03_m01: <BLN>Difficult to please.
MID_LGV_1_M00_TempleFotona_B04_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_1_M00_TempleFotona_B04_m01_001: Did you notice that of all the Dagdan pantheon, only\nFortuna's temple has no entrance on Temple Row?
MID_LGV_1_M00_TempleFotona_B04_m01_002: The truth is that her temple was built even farther\nback, out behind Dagda's temple.
MID_LGV_1_M00_TempleFotona_B04_m01_003: But no one knows for sure why they put it there.
MID_LGA_1_M00_TempleFotona_B04_m01: <BLN>It's a mystery...
MID_LGV_1_M00_ShopAnna_B01_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_1_M00_ShopAnna_B01_m01_001: I heard a strange merchant appeared recently, selling\ninteresting things—but only at night.
MID_LGV_1_M00_ShopAnna_B01_m01_002: She must be rather bold to set up her shop right in\nfront of the temple of Dagda...
MID_LGA_1_M00_ShopAnna_B01_m01: <BLN>A strange merchant!
MID_LGV_1_M00_WeaponType_B01_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_1_M00_WeaponType_B01_m01_001: Do you ever think about the weapons we use day in,\nday out? Every type has its own niche.
MID_LGV_1_M00_WeaponType_B01_m01_002: Knowing what situation each weapon is best suited\nfor is the first step to victory.
MID_LGA_1_M00_WeaponType_B01_m01: <BLN>Ever think about weapons?